+<DT><B>Returns:</B><DD><code>null</code> if no sub-protocol is selected or the name of
+          the protocol which <b>must</b> be one of the protocols listed by
+          the client. This default implementation always returns
+          <code>null</code>.</DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
