+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public class <B>WsInputStream</B><DT>extends <A HREF="http://docs.oracle.com/javase/6/docs/api/java/io/InputStream.html?is-external=true" title="class or interface in java.io">InputStream</A></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+This class is used to read WebSocket frames from the underlying socket and
+ makes the payload available for reading as an <A HREF="http://docs.oracle.com/javase/6/docs/api/java/io/InputStream.html?is-external=true" title="class or interface in java.io"><CODE>InputStream</CODE></A>. It only
+ makes the number of bytes declared in the payload length available for
+ reading even if more bytes are available from the socket.
+<P>
