+ on messages. Applications should extend this class to provide application
+ specific functionality. Applications that wish to operate on a stream basis
+ rather than a message basis should use <A HREF="../../../../org/apache/catalina/websocket/StreamInbound.html" title="class in org.apache.catalina.websocket"><CODE>StreamInbound</CODE></A>.
