king on is related to session ID generation.=0A=0AI have checked the source=
 code of Tomcat 6 (6.0.24) and I think I have found a mistake.=0A=0Aorg.apa=
che.catalina.session.ManagerBase=0A=0A=0ALine 567: long=A0update=A0=3D=A0((=
byte)=A0entropy[i])=A0<<=A0((i=A0%=A08)=A0*=A08);=0A=0AThis solution is not=
 perfect.=0A=0AThe update will be a 32-bit integer this way, so only the 32=
 LSB of the seed will be modified by entropy through the XOR.=0AThe byte ca=
sting should be replaced by a long casting.=0A=0Alike this: long=A0update=
=A0=3D=A0((long)=A0entropy[i])=A0<<=A0((i=A0%=A08)=A0*=A08);=0A=0AI hope yo=
u understand my point.=0A=0A=0ASincerely,Andras Rozsa
