ottom line, Tomcat 7 works a bit differently from Tomcat 5 with respect to =
welome files, probably respecting the new servlet spec =0A=0ATo your questi=
on as to "what point merging algorithms are not followed", please try this =
inside your application context and you will probably see the same: =0A=0A=
=A0=0A=0A=A0 =A0 <welcome-file-list>=0A=A0 =A0 =A0<welcome-file />=0A=A0 =
=A0 </welcome-file-list>=0A=0AThis seems to tell Tomcat 7, in plain English=
, "there are no welcome files, don't bother looking for them anywhere" ... =
=A0 =0A=0A=0AIn other words, it is NOT merged with container as intended/in=
dicated below in your message.=A0 =0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A_________________=
