HI,

as the spec dictates every jsp file that specify session=3D"true"  (this =
is default in tomcat  )  forces a new session to be created, wether or =
not we are using the session inside the jsp file.

the session is triggered for creation at PageContextImpl file, isn't =
meaningfull  to make this session creation on demand ?=20
Most of the jsp files are using the session for checking an attribute =
presence, so creating a new session just for get operations  is a wast =
of memory.
do I miss something ? I am ready to do the development, maybe someone is =
working on this already ?=20


best regards,
Gunay Arslan


